														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-4829758">
									

<p>I'm still a newcomer here, but I like it. The idea of a physical space that represents fundamental laws in our universe is pretty fascinating, especially as someone who loves physics and reality SCPs that alter fundamental forces. I also like the narrative potential with the previous universe and some of the machinery being broken, since it leaves a lot to be explored and built upon. Not sure about the cosmic horror aspect, since its difficult to pull off effectively, and isn't very scary unless the existential dread can be felt be the reader. Also, to me, this seems like something that could potentially be so integral to the SCP universe that it may be a decent candidate for 001. Again, still new, so take my opinion for whatever it's worth.</p>

							</div>

								
